Package: pbwire
Title: Protobuf Wire Codec over the pbwire C Core
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: person("pbwire", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "pbwire@example.com")
Description: Dynamic protobuf codec: named lists convert through the pbwire
    schema arena, builders encode hot loops without rebuilding. Loads a
    FileDescriptorSet at run time; the C core compiles in statically, so
    there are no runtime dependencies and no generated code.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/jinganix/pbwire
NeedsCompilation: yes
Encoding: UTF-8
